#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter:1 of
msgid "Filter groups by a predicate function."
msgstr "根据谓词函数筛选分组。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter:3 of
msgid ""
"*func* is applied to each group (as a pandas DataFrame) and must return a"
" scalar ``bool``.  Groups where *func* returns ``True`` are kept; groups "
"where it returns ``False`` are dropped.  Any other return type raises "
"``TypeError``, matching pandas semantics."
msgstr ""
"*func* 会应用于每个分组（以 pandas DataFrame 形式传入），并且必须返回标量"
" ``bool``。*func* 返回 ``True`` 的分组会被保留，返回 ``False`` 的分组会被"
"丢弃。其他返回类型会引发 ``TypeError``，与 pandas 语义一致。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter:0 of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter:8 of
msgid "Function taking a group DataFrame and returning a scalar bool."
msgstr "接收分组 DataFrame 并返回标量 bool 的函数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter:9 of
msgid ""
"Drop groups whose predicate returns ``False``.  If ``False``, those groups "
"are kept with all column values set to null, matching pandas."
msgstr ""
"丢弃谓词返回 ``False`` 的分组。若为 ``False``，则保留这些分组，并将所有"
"列值（包括分组键）置空，与 pandas 一致。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter:11 of
#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter:12 of
msgid "Additional arguments forwarded to *func*."
msgstr "转发给 *func* 的额外参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter:0 of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter:13 of
msgid ""
"LiteFrame with rows from kept groups, preserving the original column "
"order.  Row order within each group is preserved, but the global order of"
" groups follows ``sort`` (consistent with :meth:`apply`)."
msgstr ""
"包含保留分组行的 LiteFrame，保持原始列顺序。每个分组内的行顺序保持不变，"
"但分组之间的全局顺序遵循 ``sort``，与 :meth:`apply` 一致。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.filter:0 of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

